  "description": "The Longer Discourse at Assapura is sutta 39 of the Majjhima Nikāya (Middle Length Discourses). The Middle Length Discourses gather 152 suttas of the Pali canon, among them the Satipaṭṭhāna, the Alagaddūpama and the Cūḷamālukya suttas. They are preserved in Pali and translated here by Bhikkhu Sujato.",
